<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.1"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:dsp="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Dsp;assembly=Bonsai.Dsp"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>Reproduces data loss in Bonsai.Dsp.MatrixWriter using only Bonsai.Core and Bonsai.Dsp. A completing source is demultiplexed into one group per element, each of which opens its own MatrixWriter. Bonsai.IO.StreamSink schedules writer creation, writes and disposal on a per-writer EventLoopScheduler, and that scheduler is torn down as soon as the sequence completes, so queued work is discarded and most files are never written. Point Path at an empty folder, set Count, and compare the number of files produced against Count. Note the Timer period must stay at zero, which is its default and so does not appear in this file. Giving it any interval paces the source, letting each writer start before the next is created, and hides the fault.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="Value" DisplayName="Path" Description="An empty folder to write the records into." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
          <Value>C:\temp_data\matrixwriter-repro</Value>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject">
        <Name>Root</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Timer">
          <rx:DueTime>PT0S</rx:DueTime>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="Count" Description="How many records to write. One file is expected per record." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
          <rx:Count>50</rx:Count>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:ElementIndex" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:GroupBy">
        <rx:KeySelector>Index</rx:KeySelector>
        <rx:ElementSelector />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
        <Name>WriteRecord</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>Record</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Record</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:CreateObservable">
              <Name>WriteFile</Name>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
                    <Name>Data</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Data</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Index</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Root</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Data</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Key</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Format">
                    <Format>{0}\record_{1}.bin</Format>
                    <Selector>Item1,Item2</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="Path" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="dsp:MatrixWriter">
                      <dsp:Suffix>None</dsp:Suffix>
                      <dsp:Overwrite>true</dsp:Overwrite>
                      <dsp:Layout>ColumnMajor</dsp:Layout>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="11" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Switch" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="3" To="5" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>